{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deceived Of Joy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.poster.avif?t=1760604178\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.webm?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.mp4?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing our games Demo you undertake a very abnormal life living in a Hotel, you play through the eyes of a character going through &quot; The Miracle Drugs &quot; otherworldly effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/18a054299d99c0c5874f3f6419eabab7.poster.avif?t=1760604178\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/18a054299d99c0c5874f3f6419eabab7.webm?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/18a054299d99c0c5874f3f6419eabab7.mp4?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take this &quot; Miracle Pill &quot; a new pill that has gone global, a pill that erases doubt and depression. But after loosing your pills, the world around you starts to change. Almost like the pills have made you see things you weren't meant to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/c6afc8276a37750c01ac8232ce6c74da.poster.avif?t=1760604178\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/c6afc8276a37750c01ac8232ce6c74da.webm?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/c6afc8276a37750c01ac8232ce6c74da.mp4?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter creatures, you'll run for your life, experience world breaking illusions. Slowly loosing your mind not knowing what you'll see next. interacting with the world, jump scares and abnormalities and story telling to keep you hooked. Your goal after all is to survive and beat the nightmare you've lost your self in.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.poster.avif?t=1760604178\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.webm?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.mp4?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes extensive audio, atmospheric noises, characters, unique creatures, story telling, translated language subtitles and option setting support. Gameplay For the Demo would be around 10 minutes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- LevelBound Studios</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080360?t=1760604178","background_raw