self in.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.poster.avif?t=1760604178\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.webm?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.mp4?t=1760604178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes extensive audio, atmospheric noises, characters, unique creatures, story telling, translated language subtitles and option setting support. Gameplay For the Demo would be around 10 minutes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- LevelBound Studios</h2>","developers":["LevelBound Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4001800","name":"Deceived Of Joy"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080360/bebe24043f9180026d37c80d9b241b7b12091da0/header.jpg?t=1760604178","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Deceived Of Joy Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["LevelBound Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","des